{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"summary\": \"他从头到尾都在处理亲密与自主之间的拉扯：他想靠近别人、得到接纳并在感情中安心，却又怕失去自己的主意，因此反复求证对方的回应能否证明自己值得被爱、保证幸福不会消失。到了结尾，他不再要求未来提供永远不会失去的保证，开始珍惜眼前的幸福，自己做选择并承担靠近的风险；但亲密与独立之间的矛盾、对失去的担忧，以及选择之后仍可能受伤的风险，都还没有消失。\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"1\": \"C\",\n    \"2\": \"A\",\n    \"3\": \"D\",\n    \"4\": \"B\",\n    \"5\": \"A\",\n    \"6\": \"C\"\n  },\n  \"one_thing\": 6,\n  \"fill_in\": 3\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5f1d9b81-dab3-4160-ac23-ab72c9dfb2db", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261021T070259951654Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.781, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T07:03:43.750487+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5264be8753f17cc424cbb0510d596fc59f022202ee30eaae42aa51bce0852acd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "722a90984d40295e55caba596589f01b85b2b784e2b74dd51fb8de09bf479560", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_eviden